<p>
  A <a href="https://tiptap.dev">Tiptap</a> editor using Tiptap's own
  <code>Collaboration</code> and <code>CollaborationCursor</code> extensions.
  Tiptap stores its content as a <code>Y.XmlFragment</code> named
  <code>default</code>. Other people's carets and selections come through
  awareness, which the server passes along without saving.
</p>
<p>
  The editor isn't created until the first sync finishes. Tiptap's
  Collaboration extension writes an empty paragraph when it starts. If it
  starts before the server's copy arrives, every client adds its own empty
  paragraph to the shared text.
</p>
